# prepare LAMMPS for simulation #
#################################

# OpenMP package
package omp ${nProc} neigh yes
package omp 8 neigh yes
set 8 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task
using multi-threaded neighbor list subroutines

# real units
units real
# atom style
atom_style hybrid angle ellipsoid
WARNING: Atom style hybrid defines both, per-type and per-atom masses; both must be set, but only per-atom masses will be used (src/atom_vec_hybrid.cpp:132)
# periodic boundaries
boundary f f f
# atom map
atom_modify id yes map hash
read_data /home/andrew/Desktop/Projects/btree_chromo/examples/simulating_chromosome_with_replication_chunky/data.example_t90000 extra/bond/per/atom 2
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (-1851 -1851 -1851) to (1851 1851 1851)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  15292 atoms
  5050 ellipsoids
  scanning bonds ...
  3 = max bonds/atom
  scanning angles ...
  1 = max angles/atom
  reading bonds ...
  5000 bonds
  reading angles ...
  5000 angles
Finding 1-2 1-3 1-4 neighbors ...
  special bond factors lj:    0        0        0       
  special bond factors coul:  0        0        0       
     2 = max # of 1-2 neighbors
     2 = max # of 1-3 neighbors
     4 = max # of 1-4 neighbors
