  reading atoms ...
  15292 atoms
  5050 ellipsoids
  scanning bonds ...
  3 = max bonds/atom
  scanning angles ...
  1 = max angles/atom
  reading bonds ...
  5000 bonds
  reading angles ...
  5000 angles
Finding 1-2 1-3 1-4 neighbors ...
  special bond factors lj:    0        0        0       
  special bond factors coul:  0        0        0       
     2 = max # of 1-2 neighbors
